CORE
main.cpp
--cpp20
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ equal pointers: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ distinct objects: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ array elements are ordered: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
